      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_55b19c5a",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Overall Intent; overall-intent-description: The scene depicts a smiling Black man and a smiling white woman embracing outdoors. The text overlay reads: 'when you ready for bed but bae won't leave you alone.' The meme's intent is to humorously depict a common romantic scenario where one partner is ready to sleep but the other is unwilling to let go. There is no toxicity present in this meme. The image does not contain any disparaging metaphors or stereotypes targeting any protected group. The humor is lighthearted and relatable, focusing on a universal experience in relationships without mocking or harming any individual or community. The intent is to evoke laughter and relatability through the juxtaposition of the affectionate image with the text describing a mundane, endearing domestic situation.",
