      "@type": "Scene",
      "instance_name": "embrace_scene",
      "label": "couple_embracing",
      "description": "A smiling Black man and a smiling white woman are embracing outdoors. The man is on the left, wearing glasses and a plaid shirt, while the woman is on the right, with curly hair, leaning into him. They are both looking at the camera with affectionate expressions. The scene is framed by a blurred natural background, suggesting an outdoor setting. The text overlay humorously contrasts the romantic intimacy with the mundane situation of one partner being ready for bed but unwilling to let go.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
